  "description": "Flat Bar, Gravel, SuperRoad - Dominate (nearly) Any Road: This Mulekick Express Comp Disc brake, gravel road bike can do it all. Flat bars give you a comfortable and commanding upright position. Special Endurance design with higher headtubes for even more upright and comfortable riding and control.\n\nComes with 40c Maxxis tires, capable of using up to 700x48c* to dominate gravel roads. Or swap out your own narrow 700x28c for maximum speed on your commute. Laugh and float over rough roads, chipseal and revel in your powerful Hydraulic Disc brakes through most whatever weather conditions exist.\n\nPerfect for entry to advanced level athlete wanting the performance of an aluminum frame, coupled with the precision and handling of a Carbon fork and dealing with a budget. This model has SRAM Aluminum Compact cranks for hill-crushing performance at a lighter weight.",
